    {
      "id": "wavre-prussian-iii-corps",
      "nationId": "prussians-1815",
      "name": "Thielemann's III Corps",
      "formation": "III Corps, Army of the Lower Rhine",
      "side": "Prussian",
      "summary": "Left behind as Blücher's rearguard while the rest of the army marched to Waterloo. Kemphen's brigade held Wavre's bridges against Vandamme, Luck's Landwehr the Dyle beside it, and Stülpnagel's the upstream crossings at Bierges and Limale, where Grouchy turned the flank on the 19th.",
      "notes": [
        "Luck's brigade was all Landwehr, two Kurmark regiments, where the list's brigade needs a Line regiment, which shows as a historical departure.",
        "Borcke's brigade had begun the march to Waterloo and only part of it came back to fight.",
        "A Prussian brigade was the size of another army's division, so the whole corps is here. Take the brigades you want; each is a force in itself.",
        "Each regiment's three battalions are the list's two Musketeer and one Fusilier battalions, or three Landwehr. The order of battle doesn't number the brigades' foot batteries.",
        "The corps cavalry, under Hobe, follows Nafziger's order of battle (after Plotho). The list takes line or Landwehr cavalry brigades but not both, so a corps with both shows it as a historical departure.",
        "Lottum's brigade had three Uhlan regiments where the list allows two, and Marwitz's mixed line and Landwehr cavalry, so its two Kurmark regiments are a brigade of their own here.",
        "Nafziger gives each corps three 12-pdr batteries, a howitzer battery and more 6-pdr foot and horse batteries than its brigades had; the list's reserve takes one heavy, one foot and one horse battery, so only those are here. Which horse batteries rode with the cavalry brigades is our reading.",
        "Thielemann commands as the optional Corps Commander (Albion Triumphant p. his brigade commanders at 8, the list's lowest.",
        "Commanders are at Staff Rating 8, the default for historical forces."
      ],
      "command": [
        {
          "unit": "pr15-corps-cmd",
          "name": "Lt-Gen von Thielemann",
          "variant": "Staff rating 8 (4 re-rolls)"
        }
      ],
